      "description": "the build's identifier, gpt-oss-120b-7f2c"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "gpt-oss-120b(?!-7f2c)",
      "description": "the public model's name, gpt-oss-120b, on its own (not only as part of gpt-oss-120b-7f2c)"
